  "dct_description_sm": [
    "<p style='margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px;'>Development is discouraged within the Ecosystem Connectivity Corridors as outlined in <a href='https://www.kelowna.ca/our-community/planning-projects/2040-official-community-plan/ch-14-natural-environment' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Chapter 14: Natural Environment</a> of the 2040 Official Community Plan (OCP). Further, those properties that are in the Okanagan Ecosystem Connectivity Corridor are part of the <a href='https://www.kelowna.ca/our-community/planning-projects/2040-official-community-plan/ch-21-natural-environment-dp-area' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>Natural Environment Development Permit Area</a>.  The OCP was adopted by Council on the 10th of January, 2022. Read more about the 2040 OCP on <a href='https://can01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.kelowna.ca%2Four-community%2Fplanning-projects%2F2040-official-community-plan&amp;data=04%7C01%7Ctguidi%40kelowna.ca%7C97485485906e42725aac08d9e1c5a391%7Cc6558401f1cf48cf9607c6e3d3a109f3%7C0%7C0%7C637789061227885297%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000&amp;sdata=mMpVtUH3Nz%2F8jIz5mgnnP%2Byd2hlw2SPwsNfr6ov4L8M%3D&amp;reserved=0' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>kelowna.ca.</a></p>"
